<title>JAPAN: BOJ says branch managers to hold meeting Oct 21-22.</title>
<headline>BOJ says branch managers to hold meeting Oct 21-22.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Wednesday that a regular meeting of its branch managers will be held on October 21 and 22.</p>
<p>The quarterly meeting of the central bank's branch managers is closely watched by financial market operators, as it provides clues as to any changes in the BOJ's assessment of prevailing economic conditions.</p>
